OL,4,CSecond church lead theft 'another      
OL,5,Cblow', warden says                     
OL,6,GThe warden of a 12th Century Surrey    
OL,7,Gchurch which had the lead stolen from  
OL,8,Gits roof says the damage is "just      
OL,9,Ganother blow" to the community coming  
OL,10,Gweeks after its sister site was also   
OL,11,Gtargeted.                              
OL,13,FThe theft at the Grade II* listed St   
OL,14,FMary's Church in Staines became        
OL,15,Fapparent when churchgoers arrived on   
OL,16,FSunday to find water leaking into the  
OL,17,Fvestry due to the damage.              
OL,19,FIt came two weeks after St Peter's     
OL,20,FChurch was also targeted by thieves -  
OL,21,Fwhich had been described as a "punch   
OL,22,Fin the gut" for the community.    G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
