OL,4,CLeaseholder bills for major works to   
OL,5,Caverage #15k                           
OL,6,GLeaseholders facing huge refurbishment 
OL,7,Gbills will be asked to pay an average  
OL,8,Gof #15,000 each, about half of their   
OL,9,Goriginal quote.                        
OL,11,FWoking Borough Council has reduced the 
OL,12,Fcombined repair cost to leaseholders   
OL,13,Fin 14 medium-rise blocks in the        
OL,14,FLakeview estate in Horsell from #2.6m  
OL,15,Fto #1.3m.                              
OL,17,FThe council removed combustible        
OL,18,Fcladding at the estate in 2024,        
OL,19,Fleaving homes covered with temporary   
OL,20,Fsheets to help keep out the water.     
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
